{"id": "Default/Secret Santa", "location": "Default", "name": "Secret Santa", "access": "private", "graphData": {"version": 12, "graphSettings": {"showExecutionVisualisation": true, "viewportCenterPosition": {"x": -732, "y": 2739}, "viewportScale": 0.1, "defaultUISurfaceNodeId": "ai-node-26", "theme": {"mode": "system"}}, "overlay": {"dashboard": {"visible": true, "fullscreen": true, "maximized": false, "widthPercentage": 52, "locked": false}}, "nodes": [{"id": "ai-node-1", "name": "Start here", "type": "label", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 3794, "height": 358, "socketArray": [{"socketType": "in", "name": "Width", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"NumberType\",\"type\":{\"round\":true,\"minValue\":0,\"maxValue\":1280,\"stepSize\":0.01,\"showDetails\":false,\"presetValues\":[]}}", "data": 0, "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Input", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"StringType\"}", "data": "Secret Santa\nThe top half is the organizer's page: names and rules make one draw, and each person gets a link holding only their own envelope.\nThe bottom half opens that envelope when the app is opened from such a link.\nThe page on the right shows whichever half applies."}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Font size", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"NumberType\",\"type\":{\"round\":true,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":100,\"stepSize\":1,\"showDetails\":false,\"presetValues\":[{\"text\":\"Small\",\"value\":12},{\"text\":\"Normal\",\"value\":16},{\"text\":\"H5\",\"value\":20},{\"text\":\"H4\",\"value\":24},{\"text\":\"H3\",\"value\":28},{\"text\":\"H2\",\"value\":32},{\"text\":\"H1\",\"value\":40}]}}", "data": 64, "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Text alignment", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"EnumType\",\"type\":{\"options\":[{\"text\":\"Left\",\"value\":\"left\"},{\"text\":\"Center\",\"value\":\"center\"},{\"text\":\"Right\",\"value\":\"right\"}],\"showAsButtons\":true}}", "data": "Left", "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Font weight", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"EnumType\",\"type\":{\"options\":[{\"text\":\"Regular\",\"value\":\"400\"},{\"text\":\"Bold\",\"value\":\"700\"}],\"showAsButtons\":true}}", "data": "Regular", "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Text color", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"ColorType\"}", "data": {"r": 12, "g": 12, "b": 12, "a": 1}, "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Background color", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"ColorType\"}", "data": {"r": 255, "g": 255, "b": 255, "a": 1}, "visible": false}, {"socketType": "out", "name": "Output", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"StringType\"}", "visible": false}, {"socketType": "out", "name": "ReactUI", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"DeferredReactType\"}", "visible": false}], "updateBehaviour": {"load": true, "update": true, "interval": false}}, {"id": "ai-node-2", "name": "Names", "type": "widgettextfield", "x": 0, "y": 878, "width": 220, "height": 120, "socketArray": [{"socketType": "in", "name": "Initial Value", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"StringType\"}", "data": "Grandma Amara\nGrandpa Kenji\nLuc\u00eda\nMateo\nPriya\nYusuf\nNoa", "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Label", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"StringType\"}", "data": "Names, one per line", "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Placeholder", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"StringType\"}", "data": "Luc\u00eda\nMateo\nPriya", "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Helper Text", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"StringType\"}", "data": "", "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Type", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"EnumType\",\"type\":{\"options\":[{\"text\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"password\"}],\"showAsButtons\":true}}", "data": "text", "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Multiline", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"BooleanType\"}", "data": true, "visible": false}, {"socketType": "in", "name": "Rows", "dataType": "{\"class\":\"NumberType\",\"type\":{\"round\":true,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":10,\"stepSize\":0.01,\"showDetails\":false,\"presetValues\":[]}}", "data": 7, "visible": fa